Error [E0605]: `internal.secret` is private to its module
  --> tests/ui/import_private/run.jet:5:27
    |
  5 |     print(helper.internal.secret())
    |                           ^^^^^^
 Why: A `priv module` is usable only by its enclosing module (`priv(package)`: by its package), and a `priv` field only by its type's module (D-VIS-MODULE1)
 Fix: Use `internal.secret` from inside its module, or remove `priv` from its module or field
